# App 面截图批（2026-08-24，自造合成图，assets/gen_assets.py 确定性重建）：收据/设置面板/
# 报错弹窗/登录表单/终端窗口/表格高亮格/通知横幅/文件列表/段落粗体词/日历圈选/进度条/比价卡。
# 立批之由：既有 vision 批是图表与合成色块，而 App 真正看见的是**截图**——这批补的是这块空白。
# 每张图的答案在图内唯一（无同值诱饵），字号一律 ≥ 18px；一正一反答案见金测试。
{"id": "vi-app-001", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "收据合计读取：拍收据记账是 App 的头号真实使用面；金额 21.06 在图内唯一，小计/税额/单品价都不同值，答错即抓错行"}, "task": {"user": "这张收据的合计金额（TOTAL）是多少？只回答数字，不要其他文字。", "images": ["assets/app/receipt.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)(?<![0-9])21\\.06(?![0-9])"], "must_not": ["19.50", "1.56"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-002", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Settings panel with five toggles and exactly one switched on: reading UI state out of a screenshot is what users ask this app to do, and the four OFF rows make guessing unprofitable"}, "task": {"user": "In this settings panel, which toggle is switched ON? Answer with the label of that toggle only.", "images": ["assets/app/settings.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)\\bdark\\s*mode\\b"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-003", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "报错弹窗里的错误码 OCR：用户拍报错框求助是自诊断通路的真实入口，E-4471 是图内唯一形似错误码的串，判分精确到字符"}, "task": {"user": "这个报错弹窗里的错误码是什么？只回答错误码本身。", "images": ["assets/app/error_dialog.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)\\bE-4471\\b"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-004", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Positional reading of a form: naming the SECOND field's label requires spatial ordering, not just OCR, which is exactly where small vision towers slip"}, "task": {"user": "Look at this login form. What is the label of the second input field from the top? Answer with the label text only.", "images": ["assets/app/login_form.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)\\bemail\\s+address\\b"], "must_not": ["Workspace URL", "Access token"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-005", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "带行号的终端截图定位 FAILED 行：与种子批的 ERROR 行题互补，考的是行号与内容的对应关系而不只是读出那一行文字"}, "task": {"user": "这张终端截图里，哪一行包含 FAILED？只回答行号数字，不要其他文字。", "images": ["assets/app/terminal.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?<![0-9])5(?![0-9])"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-006", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "One highlighted cell in a 4x3 table: the model must combine the highlight cue with cell lookup; 6,210 appears nowhere else in the table so a near-miss read is caught"}, "task": {"user": "One cell in this table is highlighted. What value is in the highlighted cell? Answer with the value only.", "images": ["assets/app/table_cell.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["\\b6,?210\\b"], "must_not": ["9,540", "14,880"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-007", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "通知横幅右上角的时间：横幅是最常被截给助手的一类界面，时间 09:45 是图内唯一时间串（图标上的 19 是日期不是时刻）"}, "task": {"user": "这条通知横幅右上角显示的时间是几点？只回答时间。", "images": ["assets/app/notification.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?<![0-9])0?9:45(?![0-9])"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-008", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Largest file in a file list where the sizes use different units (KB / MB): the comparison only works if the units are read, so this is a unit-aware reading probe rather than plain OCR"}, "task": {"user": "In this file list, which file is the largest? Answer with the file name only.", "images": ["assets/app/file_list.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)\\barchive\\.zip\\b"], "must_not": ["photo.heic", "budget.xlsx"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-009", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Exactly one bolded word inside a paragraph: typography is a visual signal with no textual trace, so an OCR-only pipeline cannot answer it; the heading is deliberately regular weight"}, "task": {"user": "One single word in this paragraph is printed in bold. Which word is it? Answer with that one word.", "images": ["assets/app/bold_word.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)\\bquorum\\b"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-010", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "月历网格里被红圈圈出的日期：圈选是用户在截图上做标记的常见方式，图内只有一个圈，答案唯一"}, "task": {"user": "这张日历里被红圈圈出的是几号？只回答日期数字。", "images": ["assets/app/calendar.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?<![0-9])19(?![0-9])"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-011", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Percentage label next to a progress bar: progress dialogs are routinely screenshotted when something looks stuck, and 67 is the only number rendered in the image"}, "task": {"user": "What percentage does this progress bar show? Answer with the number only.", "images": ["assets/app/progress.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["\\b67\\b"]}}}
{"id": "vi-app-012", "dimension": "vision", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "双栏比价卡的价格比较：套餐对比卡是购物/订阅场景的常见截图，要求答出更贵那一栏的名称，比单纯读数多一步比较"}, "task": {"user": "图里哪一栏的价格更高？只回答那一栏的名字。", "images": ["assets/app/compare.png"]}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_any": ["(?i)(?<![A-Za-z])Pro(?![A-Za-z])"], "must_not": ["Standard", "standard"]}}}
